              "value": "Escort From The Premises"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The casino bouncer has Grabbed a Medium or smaller target and is wielding a nonlethal weapon in the other hand\n\nThe casino bouncer makes a Strike against the grabbed target with the nonlethal weapon. If the Strike hits, it deals damage as usual and the casino bouncer moves the target 5 feet (this is forced movement) and Steps into the space the target had just occupied."
            },
