              "value": "Intimidating Stare"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, emotion, mental, visual)\n\nThe casino bouncer attempts to Demoralize a creature with a mere glance. The casino bouncer doesn't take a penalty to their Intimidation check if the target doesn't speak the same language. If the bouncer rolls a critical success, the target can't reduce the value of its frightened condition until 1d4 rounds have passed."
